[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2530141847","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100124#issuecomment-2530141847","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100124","id":2530141847,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WzuaX","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T03:05:28Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T03:07:38Z","body":"So I did a bit of testing on this, and randomly happened to notice that if I enable TLS in the Editor settings\n(Editor > Editor Settings > Export > Web > Use TLS), then the problem seems to go away. \n\nThis allows web exported projects to load in the remote debugger. However there are still TLS handshake errors in the console output (TLS handshake error: -27648).\n\n```\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n  modules/mbedtls/stream_peer_mbedtls.cpp:89 - TLS handshake error: -27648\n```\n\nI couldn't find exactly what this error code means, but it seems to just repeat the same error several times and then it calms down.\nThere were no errors in the web debugger.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2530141847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2530189919","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100124#issuecomment-2530189919","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100124","id":2530189919,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Wz6Jf","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T03:39:53Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T03:41:57Z","body":"Did some more digging. Don't know why, but changing the HTTP Host from \"localhost\" to \"[::1]\" also seems to work. (I guess this is IPv6 loopback instead of IPv4? Never used it before.)\n\nThis works with TLS disabled. No handshake errors or other web debugger errors.\nTested on a couple different projects. Also still works with Firefox.\n\nSolution from this thread:\nhttps://www.reddit.com/r/godot/comments/yuzeqq/running_godot_4_html_exports_will_require/\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2530189919/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6282545370","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100124#issuecomment-6282545370","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100124","id":6282545370,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdngI2g","user":{"login":"BaconEggsRL","id":18596035,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTk2MDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18596035?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL","html_url":"https://github.com/BaconEggsRL","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BaconEggsRL/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-20T03:19:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T03:19:44Z","body":"This is no longer an issue--tested on 4.3 again and 4.7.2 with no errors.\nMost likely due to Chrome updates. Closing this issue as solved.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6282545370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]